WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Ryu blocks back medium kick before Alex holds backward at the recorded spacing.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Held standing heavy kick Punish Counters after the recorded Ryu OD uppercut misses.

3
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.900
The held heavy punch links after the launch.

4
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:13.400
